	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  messagebox dans un trigger]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=9681#p9681"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ça fonctionne pour moi :</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>NOTICE:&#160; hello<br />Query returned successfully: 1 row affected, 123 ms execution time.</p></div></blockquote></div><p>Voici ma base :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE FUNCTION tf1() RETURNS trigger
    LANGUAGE plpgsql
    AS $$begin
raise notice &#039;hello&#039;;
return new;
end$$;

CREATE TABLE t1 (
    c1 integer NOT NULL,
    c2 boolean,
    c3 text
);

INSERT INTO t1 VALUES (1, true, &#039;un&#039;);

CREATE TRIGGER tr1 BEFORE UPDATE ON t1 FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE PROCEDURE tf1();</code></pre></div>]]></content>
